Description: serialize the PersonManager database connection (m52xq)
 The persondb connection of the PersonManager singleton was used from the GUI thread and the
 avatar image provider threads at once: SQLite heap corruption, SIGSEGV in sqlite3DbMallocRawNN
 (plasma-dialer opening the call view: contact name + avatar). Recursive mutex around every use
 and around the creation of the singleton.
Author: Asdlerto Korry <korryasdlerto@gmail.com>
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-08
---
--- a/src/personmanager.cpp
+++ b/src/personmanager.cpp
@@ -10,10 +10,22 @@
 #include "kpeople_debug.h"
 
 #include <QDir>
+#include <QMutexLocker>
+#include <QRecursiveMutex>
 #include <QSqlQuery>
 #include <QStandardPaths>
 #include <QVariant>
 
+/*
+ * The one database connection of the PersonManager singleton is used from several threads: the GUI thread
+ * (PersonData of a QML binding) and the image provider threads of KPeopleDeclarative (avatars, PersonData in
+ * QQuickImageProvider::requestImageResponse). Unserialized, two threads ran queries on it at the same time and
+ * corrupted SQLite's heap (SIGSEGV in sqlite3DbMallocRawNN, plasma-dialer opening the call view: name + avatar).
+ * Every use of the connection and the creation of the singleton are serialized; recursive because mergeContacts()
+ * and unmergeContact() call contactsForPersonUri().
+ */
+static QRecursiveMutex s_dbMutex;
+
 #if HAVE_QTDBUS
 #include <QDBusConnection>
 #include <QDBusMessage>
